<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Name That Composer" id="0015dc53" height="400" width="556" hascredits="1" lang="E" basecontroltype="MatchGame" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="matchgame" sequence="1" slideid="1" topbuckettype="Image" bottombuckettype="Text" itemsperbucket="6" solvedimagepos="Top" solvedaudiopos="Top" solvedtextpos="Bottom"><standardslide><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body>&lt;html&gt;Relaciona cada obra musical con su compositor.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title/></caption><items><item id="1"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T047357A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B826C77</imagerefid><audiofile>T630098A.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82AC2F</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Sinfonía nº5&lt;/i&gt;</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Ludwig van Beethoven</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T047357A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B826C77</imagerefid><audiofile>T630098A.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82AC2F</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>La &lt;i&gt;Sinfonía nº 5&lt;/i&gt; de Beethoven se abre con una sobrecogedora melodía de cuatro notas.
</body><title>Ludwig van Beethoven</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="2"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">t070453a.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B82904B</imagerefid><audiofile>T048188B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>42D95BA2</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Sinfonía nº 40&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">t070453a.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B82904B</imagerefid><audiofile>T048188B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>42D95BA2</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>La &lt;i&gt;40&lt;/i&gt;, la última sinfonía compuesta por Mozart, es una de las mejores obras de este compositor. 

</body><title>Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="3"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012078A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D2B</imagerefid><audiofile>T048129B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F55</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Toccata y fuga&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Johann Sebastian Bach</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012078A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D2B</imagerefid><audiofile>T048129B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F55</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>La &lt;i&gt;Toccata y fuga&lt;/i&gt; es un buen ejemplo del virtuosismo que Bach exigía del intérprete en sus composiciones para órgano.

</body><title>Johann Sebastian Bach</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="4"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012135A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D64</imagerefid><audiofile>T046586B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82E712</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>Sinfonía &lt;i&gt;Londres&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Joseph Haydn</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012135A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D64</imagerefid><audiofile>T046586B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82E712</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>En la década de 1790, Haydn viajó a Inglaterra, donde compuso su sinfonía &lt;i&gt;Londres&lt;/i&gt;.
</body><title>Joseph Haydn</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="5"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T040487A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B825471</imagerefid><audiofile>T047936B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826E9C</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;El Mesías&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Georg Friedrich Händel</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T040487A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B825471</imagerefid><audiofile>T047936B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826E9C</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>Esta parte de &lt;i&gt;El Mesías&lt;/i&gt; de Händel son los gloriosos &quot;Coros del Aleluya&quot;.
</body><title>Georg Friedrich Händel</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="6"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">001ad621.jpg</image><imagerefid>42D9D7B0</imagerefid><audiofile>T048202B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F9D</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Las cuatro estaciones&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Antonio Vivaldi</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">001ad621.jpg</image><imagerefid>42D9D7B0</imagerefid><audiofile>T048202B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F9D</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>Este fragmento de &lt;i&gt;Las cuatro estaciones&lt;/i&gt; de Vivaldi corresponde al concierto de &quot;Invierno&quot;. Cierra los ojos y nota el frío…
</body><title>Antonio Vivaldi</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="7"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012150A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D72</imagerefid><audiofile>T046897B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826ACD</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Sinfonía italiana&lt;/i&gt;</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Felix Mendelssohn</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012150A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D72</imagerefid><audiofile>T046897B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826ACD</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>A Mendelssohn le llegó la inspiración para su &lt;i&gt;Sinfonía italiana&lt;/i&gt; estando en ese país a principios de la década de 1830.
</body><title>Felix Mendelssohn</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="8"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">1e67a8b1.jpg</image><imagerefid>3E14086A</imagerefid><audiofile>t978194a.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82B8EC</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Rigoletto&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Giuseppe Verdi</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">1e67a8b1.jpg</image><imagerefid>3E14086A</imagerefid><audiofile>t978194a.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82B8EC</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>La ópera de Verdi &lt;i&gt;Rigoletto&lt;/i&gt; presenta a un bufón cortesano con joroba.
</body><title>Giuseppe Verdi</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="9"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012092A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D3A</imagerefid><audiofile>T046445B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82E66E</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Sinfonía nº 4&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Johannes Brahms</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012092A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D3A</imagerefid><audiofile>T046445B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82E66E</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>Brahms compuso su &lt;i&gt;Sinfonía nº 4&lt;/i&gt; en 1885.
</body><title>Johannes Brahms</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="10"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012193A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D9F</imagerefid><audiofile>T048204B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F9F</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;La Valquiria&lt;/i&gt;

</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Richard Wagner</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012193A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D9F</imagerefid><audiofile>T048204B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B826F9F</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;La Valquiria&lt;/i&gt; es una de las cuatro óperas que forman la obra cumbre de Wagner: &lt;i&gt;El anillo del nibelungo&lt;/i&gt;.
</body><title>Richard Wagner</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="11"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T037158A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B8247AE</imagerefid><audiofile>T046519B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82697D</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>Sinfonía &lt;i&gt;del Nuevo Mundo&lt;/i&gt;
</body><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption></topbucket><bottombucket><image height="0" width="0"/><imagerefid/><audiofile/><audiorefid/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>Antonín Dvorák</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></bottombucket><solvedbucket><image height="0" width="0">T037158A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B8247AE</imagerefid><audiofile>T046519B.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82697D</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="5" bodystyleid="4"><body>La sinfonía de Dvorák titulada &lt;i&gt;del Nuevo Mundo&lt;/i&gt; expresa la admiración de su compositor por los Estados Unidos.

</body><title>Antonín Dvorák</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption></solvedbucket></item><item id="12"><topbucket><image height="0" width="0">T012187A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B822D97</imagerefid><audiofile>T049428A.mp3</audiofile><audiorefid>1B82EE42</audiorefid><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;i&gt;Obertura 1812&lt;/i&gt;
